WEBVTT

00:00.633 --> 00:02.266
Hpa tuna mlinganyo,

00:02.266 --> 00:05.433
unasema tano mara x toa tatu

00:05.433 --> 00:09.321
ni sawa na nne mara x jumlisha tatu.

00:09.321 --> 00:10.867
Hivyo, tunachotakiwa kufanya ni kutafuta

00:10.867 --> 00:13.234
thamani ya x, hivyo kuna namba kadhaa

00:13.234 --> 00:15.233
ambazo kama nikichukua tano, na kuizidisha kwa hiyo namba,

00:15.233 --> 00:17.533
toa tatu kwenye hiyo namba, itakuwa

00:17.533 --> 00:20.166
sawa na kama tukichukua nne mara hiyo namba

00:20.166 --> 00:22.101
na kuongeza tatu.

00:22.101 --> 00:26.402
Na kabla ya kuanza kukokotoa hivi vitu,

00:26.402 --> 00:28.433
hebu tuone kama tunaweza kujaribu

00:28.433 --> 00:32.066
kitu kinachokidhi swali hili.

00:32.066 --> 00:34.900
Na hivyo, nina machaguo matatu, nina x inaweza kuwa

00:34.900 --> 00:36.933
sawa na tano, x inaweza kuwa sawa na sita,

00:36.933 --> 00:38.966
na x inaweza kuwa sawa na saba.

00:38.966 --> 00:42.700
Simamisha hii video na utafute jibu

00:42.700 --> 00:46.400
ipi kati ya hizi x inakidhi mahitaji ya swali letu,

00:46.400 --> 00:51.366
ni thamani ipi inafanya huu mlinganyo kuwa kweli.

00:51.627 --> 00:55.700
Kwa hiyo, nakadiria kuwa umejaribu,

00:55.700 --> 00:59.033
hivyo hebu tufanyie kazi kila moja, hatua kwa hatua.

00:59.033 --> 01:01.333
Tuone hii ya kwanza: kama x ni sawa na tano,

01:01.333 --> 01:05.933
kisha ili hii iwe sahihi, tano mara tano,

01:05.933 --> 01:10.666
tano mara x, hivyo ni tano mara tano toa tatu

01:10.666 --> 01:13.533
inatakiwa kuwa sawa na nne mara, kila kitu tunachokiona

01:13.533 --> 01:15.066
tutaweka tano kwenye x,

01:15.066 --> 01:17.666
nne mara, ngoja nifanye hii.

01:17.666 --> 01:20.133
Ngoja niweke rangi.

01:20.133 --> 01:21.866
Hii ni sawa na kusema

01:21.866 --> 01:26.866
tano mara tano

01:28.737 --> 01:33.133
toa tatu, hebu tufanye kwa rangi sawa,

01:33.300 --> 01:38.300
toa tatu, inatakiwa kuwa sawa na nne mara tano,

01:39.712 --> 01:44.712
nne mara tano jumlisha tatu, jumlisha tatu.

01:45.733 --> 01:47.500
Kubadili rangi si rahisi.

01:47.500 --> 01:48.633
Jumlisha tatu.

01:48.633 --> 01:49.700
Sasa, hii ni sawa?

01:49.700 --> 01:52.666
Hebu tuone, tano mara tano ni 25, itakuwa

01:52.666 --> 01:57.666
25 toa tatu, inatakiwa kuwa sawa na 20 jumlisha tatu.

01:58.766 --> 02:03.334
25 toa tatu ni 22, inatakiwa kuwa sawa na 23.

02:03.334 --> 02:05.000
Hapana, hii si sawa.

02:05.000 --> 02:10.000
Hivyo, x si sawa na tano, hivyo hili si jibu.

02:11.100 --> 02:12.833
Tujaribu x ni sawa na sita.

02:12.833 --> 02:15.700
Kwa hiyo, kwa mara nyingine, tutafanya tano mara x,

02:15.700 --> 02:17.283
ambayo itakuwa sita, ngoja tuandike,

02:17.283 --> 02:22.283
toa tatu inatakiwa kuwa sawa na nne mara x,

02:22.313 --> 02:26.309
jumlisha tatu, na hapa x ni sita,

02:26.309 --> 02:28.033
hivyo itakuwa tano mara sita toa tatu

02:28.033 --> 02:30.466
inatakiwa kuwa sawa na nne mara sita jumlisha tatu.

02:30.912 --> 02:32.566
Tano mara sita ni ngapi?

02:32.566 --> 02:36.500
Ni 30 toa tatu, inatakiwa kuwa sawa

02:36.500 --> 02:40.900
na nne mara sita ambayo ni 24, na kisha jumlisha tatu.

02:40.900 --> 02:43.033
Hii ni sahihi, 30 toa tatu ni 27,

02:43.494 --> 02:47.600
ambayo ni sawa na 24 jumlisha 3, ni sawa na 27.

02:47.600 --> 02:51.133
Hivyo x kuwa sawa na 6 inakidhi swali letu,

02:51.133 --> 02:54.233
ni jibu, na tutaona baadae,

02:54.233 --> 02:57.033
jibu la swali hili hapa.

02:57.033 --> 02:58.966
X sawa na sita ni sahihi.

02:58.966 --> 03:00.800
Sasa, tujaribu kuthibitisha

03:00.800 --> 03:04.033
kuwa x ni sawa na saba kuwa si sahihi.

03:04.033 --> 03:05.633
Kwa hiyo tutakwenda haraka kidogo.

03:05.633 --> 03:07.600
Hivyo kama x ni sawa na saba, tutapata

03:07.600 --> 03:12.466
tano mara saba toa tatu inatakiwa kuwa sawa

03:12.466 --> 03:16.866
na ne mara saba jumlisha tatu.

03:16.866 --> 03:19.533
Na hivyo, tutapata, na katika zote

03:19.533 --> 03:22.100
tunaanza na kuzidisha kwanza, mpangilio wa matendo ya ukokotoaji,

03:22.100 --> 03:23.733
na ni wazi wakati unapoona aina

03:23.733 --> 03:26.833
ya mtazamo wa kialjebra hapa, hivyo tutafanya

03:26.833 --> 03:31.833
35 toa tatu inatakiwa kuwa sawa na 28 jumlisha tatu,

03:32.309 --> 03:36.433
35 toa tatu ni 32, 28 jumlisha tatu ni 31,

03:36.433 --> 03:38.466
hizi haziko sawa.

03:38.466 --> 03:43.300
Hivyo hili si jibu la swali letu la asili.
